  "cves": [
    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-19200",
      "publishedDate": "2026-08-24T03:22:14.118Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-08-24T03:22:14.118Z",
      "description": "The Velociraptor verify() VQL function allows a user to verify an artifact for syntatic and other issues. Due to an implementation fault in this VQL function, the global artifact repository is used which allows callers to overwrite existing artifacts without the required permissions.  The attacker need only have the NOTEBOOK_EDIT permission (e.g. an analyst role) to be able to call this function.",
      "severity": 8.9,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Rapid7 Velociraptor\n🔓 漏洞类型：Missing Authorization, Code Injection (CWE-862, CWE-94)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "http://docs.velociraptor.app/announcements/advisories/cve-2026-19200/",
          "type": "reference"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/Velocidex/velociraptor/pull/4962",
          "type": "reference"
        }
      ],
